{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQ8jYaRu52apXPhaHBEJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NBj9XRPyn5VussFJAy2KMr","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kalethabh/Anuncios con IA/temp/_landings/cayenne-pepper-1e4543/imagenes-nuevas.json","content":"{\n  \"imagenes\": [\n    {\n      \"imagen\": \"img0\",\n      \"funcion\": \"Primera impresión: muestra el producto en la vida diaria de una mujer como la clienta, en casa y tranquila.\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Warm lifestyle e-commerce photo, square format. A real, smiling Colombian woman around 55 years old, natural gray-streaked hair, wearing a cozy earth-toned wool cardigan (terracotta and camel), sitting at a wooden kitchen table in a cold-climate Colombian home on a chilly afternoon. Soft golden window light and a warm lamp glow. She holds the red Cayenne Pepper supplement pouch (use the attached product photo as exact reference, label sharp and fully legible) in one hand and a steaming cup of black coffee (tinto) in the other, looking relaxed and content toward the camera. On the table: a few glossy red softgel capsules and two or three fresh red cayenne chili peppers on a small ceramic plate, a folded wool blanket on the chair. Background in cream and peach tones with muted cayenne-red accents (#A62737, #6B1421), small golden yellow details (#F2B01E). Shallow depth of field, authentic, not posed like a stock model. No text in the image. No hospital, no veins, no anatomy, no cold gray or blue tones, no other brands.\",\n      \"aspecto\": \"1:1\",\n      \"usar_foto\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"imagen\": \"img1\",\n      \"funcion\": \"Nombra el dolor para que la clienta se reconozca: los pies helados de noche y las piernas pesadas al final del día.\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Meta e-commerce ad creative, square format, empathetic problem image. Nighttime bedroom in a cold-climate Colombian home: close-up of a woman's feet in thick knitted wool socks peeking out from under a heavy wool blanket on a neatly made bed, soft warm bedside lamp light. A subtle cool feeling only around the toes (tiny frost-like sparkle effect), while the rest of the scene stays warm cream, peach and muted cayenne red; no gray or blue backgrounds. In a small inset circle at the bottom corner: a woman around 58 in earth-toned clothes sitting on the edge of the bed, rubbing her tired legs at the end of the day, gentle expression, not dramatic. Large bold Spanish headline at the top in deep red #6B1421 on a cream band: \\\"¿Te acuestas con los pies helados y ni con medias se calientan?\\\". Below, smaller text with three short lines with small golden #F2B01E icons: \\\"Pies fríos toda la noche\\\", \\\"Piernas pesadas al final del día\\\", \\\"A las 3 de la tarde ya no das más\\\". Clean, readable typography, high contrast, mobile-first layout. No product in this image, no hospital, no veins, no anatomy, no heart imagery, no fear.\",\n      \"aspecto\": \"1:1\",\n      \"usar_foto\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"imagen\": \"img2\",\n      \"funcion\": \"Muestra la solución y cómo funciona en sencillo: el ritual de 2 cápsulas al día y el calorcito que llega a pies y manos.\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Meta e-commerce ad creative, square format, solution and simple mechanism. Warm cream-to-peach background with soft lamp light. Left side: a smiling Colombian woman around 60 in a camel wool sweater, sitting at a wooden kitchen table with a plate of food and a cup of tinto, holding two glossy red softgel capsules in her open palm. Next to her, the red Cayenne Pepper pouch (use the attached product photo as exact reference, label sharp). Right side: a simple, friendly flat illustration of a woman's silhouette with soft warm golden-orange glow waves flowing gently down to the hands and feet (abstract warmth, no veins, no organs, no anatomy). Large bold Spanish headline at the top in #A62737: \\\"El ritual del calorcito\\\". Subheadline: \\\"2 cápsulas al día con la comida\\\". Four benefit chips with small golden #F2B01E check icons, in deep red #6B1421 text on cream: \\\"Pies menos helados\\\", \\\"Piernas más livianas\\\", \\\"Más ánimo en la tarde\\\", \\\"Sin ardor en la boca\\\". Clean, high-contrast, mobile-readable typography. No medical claims, no heart, no hospital, no cold blue or gray tones.\",\n      \"aspecto\": \"1:1\",\n      \"usar_foto\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"imagen\": \"img3\",\n      \"funcion\": \"Da confianza mostrando qué trae la bolsa: cápsulas blandas de cayena, cuántas son y para cuántos días.\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Meta e-commerce product creative, square format. Hero shot of the red Cayenne Pepper pouch (use the attached product photo as exact reference, label perfectly sharp and legible) standing on a warm wooden kitchen table, a small pile of glossy translucent red softgel capsules spilling in front of it, and three fresh red cayenne chili peppers beside them. A folded cream wool blanket and a steaming cup in the soft-focus background. Warm afternoon window light, cream and peach background with muted cayenne red (#A62737) accents and tiny golden (#F2B01E) highlights. Large bold Spanish headline at the top in #6B1421: \\\"La cayena de siempre, en cápsula\\\". Four clean badges with small golden icons around the product: \\\"60 cápsulas blandas\\\", \\\"Rinde 30 días\\\", \\\"Sin transgénicos\\\", \\\"Sin ardor\\\". No other ingredient names, no milligrams, no certification seals, no other brands. Crisp, premium, mobile-readable.\",\n      \"aspecto\": \"1:1\",\n      \"usar_foto\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"imagen\": \"img4\",\n      \"funcion\": \"Hace que la oferta se vea real: muestra lo que llega a la casa en cada combo.\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Use the original product photo of the red Cayenne Pepper pouch as-is (no generation): clean product image for the combo cards.\",\n      \"aspecto\": \"1:1\",\n      \"usar_foto\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"resumen\": \"Hice cuatro imágenes para la galería y los anuncios, en el mismo orden que la plantilla: una mujer como tu clienta con su tinto y la bolsa, el dolor de los pies helados de noche, el ritual de 2 cápsulas con el calorcito que baja a pies y manos, y qué trae la bolsa (60 cápsulas, 30 días, sin transgénicos, sin ardor). Todo en luz cálida, con cobijas, medias de lana y tonos crema y rojo cayena, sin nada de hospital ni del corazón. En los combos va la foto real de tu producto, tal cual. No puse otros ingredientes, miligramos ni sellos porque aún no están confirmados.\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12962,"cache_read_input_tokens":4624,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12962},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dc44cf4f-151c-4791-8c40-211b17d9fdac","uuid":"67117063-6193-4604-b33f-41b5c1322420","timestamp":"2026-11-25T18:39:48.794Z","request_id":"req_011ChQ8jYRFppuEfBpnRk5N9","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01NBj9XRPyn5VussFJAy2KMr":{"file_path":"/Users/kalethabh/Anuncios con IA/temp/_landings/cayenne-pepper-1e4543/imagenes-nuevas.json","content":"{\n  \"imagenes\": [\n    {\n      \"imagen\": \"img0\",\n      \"funcion\": \"Primera impresión: muestra el producto en la vida diaria de una mujer como la clienta, en casa y tranquila.\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Warm lifestyle e-commerce photo, square format. A real, smiling Colombian woman around 55 years old, natural gray-streaked hair, wearing a cozy earth-toned wool cardigan (terracotta and camel), sitting at a wooden kitchen table in a cold-climate Colombian home on a chilly afternoon. Soft golden window light and a warm lamp glow. She holds the red Cayenne Pepper supplemen